{
 "_about": "Click placement on the view work plane, captured from the reference (captures K-W and K-W2, tasks 9395 and 9456). Frame = the construction plane's local frame (identity when none is pinned; world = origin + Rx(rot_x_deg) * frame). Families: PR = the most-facing frame axis through the focus, rounded to 10*grid in perspective after a q pre-snap (exact in ortho), the hit then snapped to q = nice_up(1/px_per_m) on EVERY channel incl. the depth; AXIS-FOCUS(PR) = PR under a pin (plane-local); NICE = PR for the action-centre relocate click; FOCUS-PLANE = the ortho anchor in item selection mode; ORTHO-PRIOR / PRIOR-* = the pre-press centre's depth (component selection mode); RAW / R13 / Q / OWN = the refuted families (unrounded focus / focus to 0.05 / focus to q / the plane's own normal through its origin).",
 "rule": {
  "perspective": "offset = dnint(dnint(f/q)*q / (10*grid)) * 10*grid on the most-facing frame axis; hit = ray cap that plane; point = snap(hit, q)",
  "orthographic": "offset = f; point = snap(hit, q) on EVERY channel incl. the depth (W2c_item: f 0.7133 -> 0.715)",
  "relocate_orthographic_component_mode": "depth = pre-press centre (unsnapped, the K-W W2b / \u00a729 law; W2c_ctrl here)",
  "relocate_orthographic_item_mode": "the anchor plane (FOCUS-PLANE/q) even with geometry (W2c_item_ctrl); the item pivot prior is NOT read",
  "relocate_component_mode_empty_mesh": "the move tool refuses to arm (no data) -- no relocate happens (b1 W2c / W2d void)",
  "nice_up": "smallest m*10^e >= x, m in {1,2,5}",
  "grid": "nice_up(25/px_per_m)",
  "q": "nice_up(1/px_per_m)",
  "dnint": "round half away from zero"
 },
